.el .ds Aq '
.TH sandogasa-pkg-health 1 2026-08-11 "sandogasa 0.19.2" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
sandogasa\-pkg\-health \- Audit package health across a sandogasa inventory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsandogasa\-pkg\-health\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Audit package health across a sandogasa inventory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS sandogasa-pkg-health checks
\fBsandogasa\-pkg\-health checks\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
List registered health checks and their cost tiers
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS sandogasa-pkg-health run
\fBsandogasa\-pkg\-health run\fR <\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\fR> <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-cheap\fR] [\fB\-\-medium\fR] [\fB\-\-expensive\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-age\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-fedora\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-epel\-version\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Run health checks against an inventory
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-inventory\fR \fI<INVENTORY>\fR
Path to inventory TOML file
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Path to report TOML file (read if exists, written after run)
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR \fI<ID>\fR
Run only these checks (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-cheap\fR
Run all cheap\-tier checks
.TP
\fB\-\-medium\fR
Run all medium\-tier checks
.TP
\fB\-\-expensive\fR
Run all expensive\-tier checks
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Run all checks regardless of tier
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-age\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Re\-run any selected check whose stored result is older than this duration (e.g. "7d", "24h")
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Limit to specific packages (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output summary as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-fedora\-version\fR \fI<N>\fR
Fedora version(s) for FTBFS / FTI tracker lookup (CSV or repeated). Rawhide trackers are always included
.TP
\fB\-\-epel\-version\fR \fI<N>\fR
EPEL version(s) for FTBFS / FTI tracker lookup (CSV or repeated)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS sandogasa-pkg-health show
\fBsandogasa\-pkg\-health show\fR [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPORT\fR> 
.PP
Display a previously\-generated health report without re\-running any checks
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Limit to specific packages (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON instead of human\-readable
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPORT\fR>
Path to an existing report TOML file
